age/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135204959,imgsize-986783.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Rahul Gandhi acquitted in 2018 defamation case over remarks on Amit Shah]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/rahul-gandhi-acquitted-in-2018-defamation-case-involving-amit-shah/articleshow/135204099.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135204099.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[A special MP/MLA court in Sultanpur dismissed a defamation case against Congress MP Rahul Gandhi on Monday. This case originated in 2018 due to remarks Gandhi made about Amit Shah during a rally. Vijay Mishra, a local BJP politician, filed the complaint alleging Gandhi's comments were defamatory. Rahul Gandhi appeared before the court in 2023, where he secured bail successfully.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/rahul-gandhi-acquitted-in-2018-defamation-case-involving-amit-shah/articleshow/135204099.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/rahul-gandhi-acquitted-in-2018-defamation-case-involving-amit-shah/articleshow/135204099.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-26T11:43:18+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Aastha Jha</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135204464,imgsize-50374.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[AI model uses face photos to estimate biological age, predict survival risk in cancer patients]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/ai-model-uses-face-photos-to-estimate-biological-age-predict-survival-risk-in-cancer-patients/articleshow/135204358.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135204358.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[A new AI model, FAHR-Face, estimates biological age and predicts cancer patient survival risk using facial photos. This model was trained on millions of images and showed an average error of about five years. Alongside this, another model identified high-risk cancer patients based on their appearance, highlighting significant survival differences. While results were promising in the US and Netherlands, further validation is needed in other populations.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/ai-model-uses-face-photos-to-estimate-biological-age-predict-survival-risk-in-cancer-patients/articleshow/135204358.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/ai-model-uses-face-photos-to-estimate-biological-age-predict-survival-risk-in-cancer-patients/articleshow/135204358.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-26T11:42:21+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Anuja Jaiswal</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135204380,imgsize-69352.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Rahul Gandhi's convoy involved in minor accident on Purvanchal Expressway]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/rahul-gandhi-convoy-on-way-to-up-crashes-on-purvanchal-expressway/articleshow/135203352.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135203352.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/rahul-gandhi-convoy-on-way-to-up-crashes-on-purvanchal-expressway/articleshow/135203352.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/rahul-gandhi-convoy-on-way-to-up-crashes-on-purvanchal-expressway/articleshow/135203352.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-26T11:03:12+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Ayush Pandey</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135203394,imgsize-52906.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[PM Modi congratulates Brazil's Lula on re-election, says will advance Global South cooperation]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/pm-modi-congratulates-brazils-lula-on-re-election-says-will-advance-global-south-cooperation/articleshow/135203263.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135203263.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/pm-modi-congratulates-brazils-lula-on-re-election-says-will-advance-global-south-cooperation/articleshow/135203263.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/pm-modi-congratulates-brazils-lula-on-re-election-says-will-advance-global-south-cooperation/articleshow/135203263.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-26T10:44:15+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Aastha Jha</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135203363,imgsize-89056.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[BJP files police complaint against Kharge over 'baap' remark targeting PM Modi]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/bjp-files-police-complaint-against-kharge-over-baap-remark-targeting-pm-modi/articleshow/135202464.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135202464.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[Bharatiya Janata Party has lodged a police complaint against Congress president Mallikarjun Kharge in Patna. The complaint relates to Kharge's remarks about Prime Minister Modi during an event during 139th birth anniversary Bihar's first CM, Shrikrishna Singh. Krishna Kumar Singh, a BJP worker, demands an apology from Kharge within 24 hours. The initial report was filed at Kotwali police station, then transferred to Gandhi Maidan.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/bjp-files-police-complaint-against-kharge-over-baap-remark-targeting-pm-modi/articleshow/135202464.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/bjp-files-police-complaint-against-kharge-over-baap-remark-targeting-pm-modi/articleshow/135202464.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-26T09:47:39+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Pranjal Pandey</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135202599,imgsize-115328.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Raids on NE drug cartels reveal illicit deals worth Rs 270cr]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/raids-on-ne-drug-cartels-reveal-illicit-deals-worth-rs-270cr/articleshow/135199368.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135199368.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/raids-on-ne-drug-cartels-reveal-illicit-deals-worth-rs-270cr/articleshow/135199368.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/raids-on-ne-drug-cartels-reveal-illicit-deals-worth-rs-270cr/articleshow/135199368.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-26T04:29:22+05:30</pubDate><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135199379,imgsize-51004.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[EAM to UN: Lead during global crises, don’t just be a spectator]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/eam-to-un-lead-during-global-crises-dont-just-be-a-spectator/articleshow/135199353.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135199353.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://